        "name": "강력한 일격",
        "summary": "노틸러스가 대상에 대한 첫 기본 공격 시 추가 물리 피해를 입히고 잠시 속박합니다.",
        "tooltip": "노틸러스의 첫 공격이 <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(100% 공격력)의 물리 피해</span>를 주며 (0.75 ~ 2)초 동안 대상을 <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">속박</span>합니다."
      },
      "en_US": {
        "name": "Staggering Blow",
        "summary": "Nautilus' first Attack against a target deals increased physical damage and roots them briefly.",
        "tooltip": "Nautilus' first Attack against a target deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(100% Attack Damage) physical damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Roots</span> them for (0.75 ~ 2) seconds."
      },
      "zh_CN": {
        "name": "排山倒海",
        "summary": "诺提勒斯对一名目标发起的第一次攻击会造成提升过的物理伤害并将其暂时禁锢。",
        "tooltip": "诺提勒斯对一名目标发起的第一次攻击会造成<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(100% 攻击力)物理伤害</span>并将其<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">禁锢</span>(0.75 ~ 2)秒。"
      }
